# Repository-level ignore rules.
#
# The application keeps its own rules in system code/.gitignore (shipped state:
# databases, processed data, trained artifacts). These rules cover the experiment
# folders and anything generated while running them.

# === Python ===
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# === Experiment outputs that are regenerable ===
# Algorithm-2 runs: features, sampled pairs, per-pass predictions and logs stay local.
Experiments/algorithm2_benchmark/results/*/work/

# === Browser test output ===
test-results/
playwright-report/

# === System / editor ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# === Environment variables (secrets) ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
